#
# Counter-example for the `math:` expression lowering
# (crates/logic/src/physical/lower.rs, MathLoweringError::BindingMissingBody): a
# math:BindingExpression root naming its operator and its bound variable, but NO
# math:argumentSlot at all — a binder must bind its variable over EXACTLY ONE body slot
# (index 0); zero slots means there is no body to bind over. Distinct from
# math:BindingMissingOperator / math:BindingMissingBoundVariable (each already
# covered): here the operator and bound variable are both well-formed, isolating the
# slot-count violation. The authored math:structuralKey lets the reasoned-graph gate
# (check_structural_key_on_rejected_expression) also reach it.
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:root a math:BindingExpression ;
    math:operator math:summationBinder ;
    math:boundVariable ex:xDecl ;
    math:structuralKey "not-a-real-digest" .

ex:xDecl a math:VariableDeclaration .
